<title>USA: CarMax Group same-store sales up 10 pct.</title>
<headline>CarMax Group same-store sales up 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Circuit City Stores Inc Tuesday reported total April sales of $576.8 million, up 18 percent from April 1996 and sales for the first two months of its fiscal year were up 18 percent to $1.23 billion.</p>
<p>Circuit City Stores Inc-CarMax Group reported April and year to date sales as follows.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$56.0	$39.8	 +41	  +10</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $117.6	$80.0	 +47	  +18</p>
<p>Total Circuit City sales also include Circuit City Stores Inc-Circuit City Group.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
